Every element is rewritten and the list keeps its size. What does the program print?

import java.util.List;
import java.util.ArrayList;

public class B44 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List<String> list = new ArrayList<>(List.of("aa", "b"));
        list.replaceAll(s -> s.toUpperCase());
        System.out.println(list);
